              "short": "$113,\\ 114,\\ 115$",
              "worked": "Let $n$ be the first integer.\n$$\\begin{align*}n+(n+1)+(n+2)&=342\\\\3n+3&=342\\\\3n&=339\\\\n&=113\\end{align*}$$\nThe integers are $113,\\ 114,\\ 115$.\nCheck: $113+114+115=342$.",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 42
