            "answer": {
              "short": "$17,\\ 19,\\ 21$",
              "worked": "Let $2n+1$ be the first odd number, where $n$ is an integer.\n$$\\begin{align*}(2n+1)+(2n+3)+(2n+5)&=57\\\\6n+9&=57\\\\6n&=48\\\\n&=8\\end{align*}$$\nThe numbers are $2(8)+1,\\ 2(8)+3,\\ 2(8)+5$, so they are $17,\\ 19,\\ 21$.\nCheck: $17+19+21=57$.",
